{
  "job_B9.6.4_20251003_115050": {
    "chunk_text": "eferan fylgan wolde & Breotone Ond \u00fea \u00e6rest longe nihtes in halgum gebedum w\u00e6s, & his tearas geat, & his bene to Gode sende \u00d0a \u00e6teawde him sona se eadgesta aldor \u00feara apostola Sanctus Petrus, & hine micelre tide \u00fe\u00e6re Ond hine w\u00e6s frignende mid \u00fea apostolican \u00feearlwisnesse, forhwon he \u00fe\u00e6t Godes eowde Cw\u00e6\u00f0 him eac to: W\u00e6re \u00feu ofergeotende minre bysne, hw\u00e6t ic fore Cristes cneohtum, \u00fea he me \u00dea w\u00e6s he se Cristes \u00feeow Laurentius mid \u00fe\u00e6s apostoles swingum & trymnessum swi\u00f0e Cwom sona on marne to \u00feam cyninge, & his hr\u00e6gl onwrag & him eawde, mid hu miclum \u00dea wundrade he swi\u00f0e, & ahsode hwylc mon to \u00f0\u00e6s gedyrstig w\u00e6re, \u00fe\u00e6t he swa miclum were \u00dea he \u00f0a se cyning gehyrde & oncneow, \u00fe\u00e6tte he se biscop fore his h\u00e6lo intingan from Cristes & sona in eallum \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6re cirican eahtum & godum freo\u00f0ode & fultemede, swa he fyrmest Ond he swelce eac sende \u00e6rendwrecan in Gallia rice, & heht ham la\u00feian \u00fea biscopas Mellitum & & heo ymb an ger ham hwurfon \u00f0\u00e6s \u00fee heo \u00e6r of Breotone ferdon. Iustus hwearf to Hrofesceastre, \u00fe\u00e6r he \u00e6r biscop w\u00e6s. Mellitum \u00feone biscop Lundenwaran onfon ne woldon, ac ma lufodon \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feeowedan heora Ond heo Eadbaldes \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges worda ne gemdon, for",
